            "review_title": "Review at Hi Salad",
            "review_text": "maggied909\nIthaca, Greece22 contributions\n0\nGreat food and service\nSep 2016\nWe had lunch at Hi Salad restaurant I had a Hi Salad with prawns, grape fruit and Avo with cashew nuts for 99VND and my husband had the Pork belly, red cabbage purée, shiiitake mushroom, caramel apple jam and balsamic spice for 139VND. We both had Tiger beer 22VND. The prices are very reasonable compared to other restaurants in this street. Beer down the road cost 69VND. Service was good and food excellent. This street at night time has a fantastic vibe. Colored lights light up water fountains and buildings are lit up with constantly changing colors. A great place to come to when in Saigon\nRead more\nWritten September 25, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
