            "review_text": "Jerri C\n2 contributions\n0\nNormally happy about this place but..\nJan 2016 • Friends\n...today I found a hair in my sandwich and I lost my appetite, told the waiter and she said sorry, after that nothing happened, so I asked them to take it away. I was not even halfway done with my meal.\n\nI decided not to say anything when I was there and just see how they would act. Expected they would take it out and maybe make a new for me but nope.. I even paid full price for it..\n\nBeen there a couple of times now and their food is generally good.. Everyone can make mistakes, this mistake was just not handled at all though..\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2016",
