            "review_title": "Review at Hi Salad",
            "review_text": "friendlyfaced\nPerth Australia40 contributions\n0\nopening night invitation\nNov 2015 • Friends\nWalking the plaza in HCMC thinking about where to have dinner when we saw lights, red carpet cameras etc and wandered over to see what was happening. Opening night for this restaurant and we were invited to have a glass of champagne then almost carried to be the first 'customers' to enter. Here we were taken up stairs by the proprietor to join in many beautiful tasting plates offered. All the staff were super friendly and well trained and the food was great. If we had not been leaving next day we would have gone back to have another meal. The facility was beautifully clean, bright and inviting. We recommend Hi Salad to tourists and locals.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 29, 2015",
